  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To meet Pitcairn&apos;s reasonable assistance needs through provision of Budgetary Aid 2014/15 is a component of Pitcairn Budgetary Aid 2014/15 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;2,990,000. It works in the following sector(s): Social Protection, Public finance management (PFM), Health policy and administrative management, Education policy and administrative management, Decentralisation and support to subnational government.</narrative>
  </description>
